data.breakpoints--断点#Breakpoints / 断点:
class Breakpoints {
  const Breakpoints({this.compactMaxWidth = 600, this.expandedMinWidth = 840});
}
Classification is based on the window width, deliberately decoupled from the device type, so foldables, small desktop windows and browser zoom all classify correctly. Pass your own Breakpoints to ZeroRouter(breakpoints: …).档位判定依据是窗口宽度（与设备类型刻意解耦），折叠屏、桌面小窗、浏览器缩放都能正确归类。可向 ZeroRouter(breakpoints: …) 传入自定义断点。The width is read from MediaQuery (which hosts, tests and the example's width presets can override), falling back to the layout constraints.宽度读取自 MediaQuery（宿主、测试与示例的宽度预设均可覆盖），回退到布局约束。

data.60-second-integration--60-秒接入#60-second:
import 'package:flutter/material.dart';
import 'package:zero_adaptive_link/zero_adaptive_link.dart';
void main() => runApp(MaterialApp.router(routerConfig: myRouter));
final myRouter = ZeroRouter(
  initialLocation: '/products',
  routes: [
    ZeroShell(
      builder: (context, shell, child) => shell.isExpanded
          ? Row(children: [
              NavigationRail(
                selectedIndex: shell.currentIndex,
                onDestinationSelected: (i) => shell.goTab(i),
                destinations: const [
                  NavigationRailDestination(
                    icon: Icon(Icons.list),
                    label: Text('Products'),
                  ),
                ],
              ),
              Expanded(child: child),
            ])
          : Scaffold(body: child),
      tabs: [
        ZeroTab(routes: [
          ZeroRoute(
            path: '/products',
            builder: (context, state) => const ProductListPage(),
            routes: [
              ZeroRoute(
                path: ':id',
                builder: (context, state) =>
                    ProductDetailPage(id: state.pathParameters['id']!),
              ),
            ],
          ),
        ]),
      ],
    ),
  ],
);
And the first link:
class ProductListPage extends StatelessWidget {
  const ProductListPage({super.key});
  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    return Scaffold(
      appBar: AppBar(title: const Text('Products')),
      body: ListView(
        children: [
          ZeroLink(
            location: '/products/42',
            child: const ListTile(title: Text('Product 42')),
          ),
        ],
      ),
    );
  }
}

data.exit-confirmation--退出确认#Exit confirmatio:
Put a PopScope on the shell builder or a tab root page:
PopScope(
  canPop: false,
  onPopInvokedWithResult: (didPop, result) {
    if (didPop) return;
    showDialog(
      context: context,
      // Share the shell navigator so the next system back works normally.
      // 共享 shell navigator，使下一次系统返回行为正常。
      useRootNavigator: false,
      builder: (context) => AlertDialog(
        title: const Text('Leave?'),
        actions: [
          TextButton(
            onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(context),
            child: const Text('Stay'),
          ),
          TextButton(
            onPressed: () => SystemNavigator.pop(),
            child: const Text('Leave'),
          ),
        ],
      ),
    );
  },
  child: child,
)
Compatible with Android predictive back. The root-state Escape key does not trigger it.兼容 Android predictive back。根态 Escape 键不触发它。

data.redirects--重定向#Redirects / 重定向:
ZeroRouter(
  // Router-level: consulted for every location.
  // 路由表级：对每个 location 生效。
  redirect: (location) =>
      location.startsWith('/mine') && !loggedIn ? '/login?from=$location' : null,
  redirectLimit: 5,
  routes: [ /* … */ ],
)
ZeroRoute(
  path: '/old',
  // Route-level: consulted when this route matches.
  // 路由级：该路由匹配时询问。
  redirect: (state) => '/new',
  builder: (context, state) => const OldPage(),
)
Both may be async (FutureOr<String?>). More than redirectLimit hops (default 5) lands on errorBuilder.两者均可为异步（FutureOr<String?>）。超过 redirectLimit 跳数（默认 5）后进入 errorBuilder。

data.declarative-zerolink--声明式#Declarative: Z:
ZeroLink(
  location: '/products/42',
  child: const ListTile(title: Text('Product 42')),
);
ZeroLink wraps its child in GestureDetector + MouseRegion (hand cursor on web / desktop) and does not require a Material ancestor. Pass onTap to override the default open behavior.ZeroLink 用 GestureDetector + MouseRegion 包裹子组件（web / 桌面显示手型光标），不强制 Material 祖先。传 onTap 可覆盖默认行为。

data.reading-route-state--读取路由状态#Reading rout:
// Inside a matched page (no BuildContext needed for the title)
ZeroRouteState.of(context).pathParameters;   // {'id': '42'}
ZeroRouteState.of(context).queryParameters;  // {'tab': 'specs'}
ZeroRouteState.of(context).arguments;        // navigation-time extras
ZeroRouteState.of(context).fullPath;         // '/products/:id'
ZeroRouteState.of(context).uri;              // Uri with query
// Shell state from anywhere / 任意位置读取 shell 状态
ZeroShellScope.maybeOf(context)?.isExpanded;
ZeroShellScope.maybeOf(context)?.currentIndex;
ZeroShellScope.maybeOf(context)?.goTab(1, initialLocation: '/cart');
// Pane title (non-null only inside two-column panes)
ZeroPaneScope.maybeOf(context)?.title;

